      "upper": "T_p <= W/p + (1-1/p)L",
      "derivation": "If last-finishing job j starts at s, no processor was idle before s while this ready job was waiting. Therefore p*s <= W-t_j, and s+t_j <= W/p+(1-1/p)t_j <= W/p+(1-1/p)L.",
